/-!
# Pub 1 strong closure: the certificate arithmetic

Every constant of `admissible_closure.py` as an exact rational, and the single
inequality the whole strict-concavity argument reduces to.  Kernel-checked; the
final margin is about `4.4e-13`, which is why none of this is done in decimals.
-/

namespace ZetaLean.Pub1

